    "horizontalBasis": "Retained Q32339 way/26434413 preserves anchor,undirected heading,9 exterior vertices,original tags and empty dimensional facts. Current ordinary PMTiles supplies the same named4-vertex hall and a4-vertex projecting base at the west/south corner. The latter is associated with a tower from the exterior pictures;it has no name/part tag. The roof overview shows two towers along one side;the opposite west/north base is an estimated6.4 m pad. The other northern polygonal map features align with public fountain points and stay excluded. Internal roof grid,glazed bay location,signed facing and complete current condition remain estimates.",
    "architecturalHeights": "No retained dimensional facts or selected current height tags exist. Estimated levels above the local floor: hall14.3 m,roof shoulders16.6 m,dome shells20 m and finials20.65 m,minaret lower shaft32 m,balcony33.4–35 m,upper shaft41 m,double-bulb cap49.2 m and finial50 m. Twenty roof bays are arranged as a visual5×4 reconstruction of the retained70×61 m envelope. The glazed bay,drum shapes,window/arch rhythm,portal positions,small cornice brackets and tower profiles are estimates,not measured elevations."
  },
